{
 "name": "boat_pinbanzhou_ling",
 "_variant": "回修檢視卷（2026-09-04）· 拼板舟（ab=boat、祖靈 zuling、swarm ×3、trait swarmHalfSplash）。依 ART_BIBLE §0.5 真實參照鐵則，照 tools/anyCreature/out/ref/boat/02.jpg（施努來所製雅美族拼板舟船頭）回修：白／黑／橘紅三色、首尾高翹收尖、舷側黑白棋盤格窄帶、船眼同心圓、木板接縫。造型語彙不再沿用 tiger_c 的炭黑底。",
 "_brief": "Tatala boat-spirit: a Tao (Yami) plank canoe that grew flying-fish wings. Bone-white plank hull painted in the only three colours the real boats use — white, black, ochre-red. Both ends wrench upward and knife to a point, the bow higher than the stern. An ochre rail caps the gunwale; under it a black band carries a dense row of white diamonds (the checkerboard trim), and two ochre hairlines and one dark seam run the length of the flanks like plank joints. On each bow cheek a big concentric boat-eye: white outer disc, black ring, white ring, ochre ring, glowing ochre pupil. Two long pale pectoral fins sweep back like a flying fish clearing the water. Feel: a drowned vessel that still hunts. Signature = the up-hooked pointed prow. Identity view = side.",
 "_swarm_recipe": "第一隻 swarm，骨架與體積寫法給其餘 6 隻 swarm 沿用：① 主鏈水平臥（frame:up）、模型高 ≤0.85、W/H ≥1.4，橫排 3 隻時 preview 每隻只有 1.05/0.62≈1.69 模型單位的 X 額度 → 含配件的總寬務必 ≤1.2；② 左右對稱靠一對 mirror 側鏈（本檔 LFin），動畫不寫 mirror_phase，兩側同拍才讀得出『一群同款』；③ 塗裝用 colors.arcs 的縱向分帶（角度吸附到 360/sides 的格，本檔 sides=24 → 15° 一格），橫向的棋盤格只能用一排小 fin 菱形貼片做。",
 "_glow_materials": "eye / glow_prow —— 材質名是給 three.js 接 emissive 用的（簡報指定的兩個發光部位）。這份 spec 只把它們塗成高亮高飽和色。",
 "_traps": "① 近黑一律用中性灰（S<0.15），shading.noise 會把偏暖的近黑擾到 HSV S>0.5，飽和面積就爆掉；② fin 帶 anchor 時 offset 會被丟掉，要埋只能把 points 內緣寫成負 u；③ 鏈段長度比 >0.923 會被 proportion BLOCK，每段都刻意做長短差；④ colors.arcs 只吃角度不吃 t，橫紋做不出來；sides=24 時 sym 只有 0/15/30/…/180 這 13 格，帶要含住整數格才看得到。",
 "_arc_map": "sides=24、canoe 斷面 16 點 → sym 0=艙底、15/30=艙壁、45=舷唇（船身最高線）、60/75/90/105/120/135/150/165=外舷由上而下、180=龍骨。分帶：0–37 艙內＝未上漆的風化木色；38–52 橘紅舷頂鑲邊（單環會被 gouraud 洗掉，所以另有一條實體 trim_red 舷條壓在同一圈上）；68–82 黑細帶（棋盤格的上緣線）；83–112 米白主面＝棋盤格與船眼落此；113–127 橘紅細線；158–180 龍骨深線；其餘米白。",

